{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "66b7e5f3-b491-8f6b-9616-b0defa108db9",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:48:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dulce Duarte",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:45:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:45:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Good morning. [pause] I'm calling about the, um, the pickleball. At the gym. What times do they have it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:45:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, happy to help. We have open pickleball at the gym a few days a week. Let me pull up the schedule. Are you looking for mornings or afternoons?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:45:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mornings is better. [pause] I don't like to drive when it's dark. With the days so short now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:45:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So the morning sessions are Tuesday and Thursday, starting at nine and running until eleven. And there's an evening one on Wednesday too, but that wouldn't suit you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tuesday and Thursday. Nine. [pause] Let me, I'm writing it down. Nine until eleven. Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. You can just show up, no sign-up needed for the open play."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And, um... [pause] what was I going to ask. Oh. Is there an age limit? For the people who play."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. For the morning open play it's adults, eighteen and up. There's no upper limit at all. We have players well into their eighties."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eighties. Well, that's good. I'm not so young. I'm not going to say how old."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need. You'll fit right in. Bring sneakers with non-marking soles for the gym floor, and a water bottle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Non-marking. Yes. [pause] Do they have the paddles there? Or do I bring my own?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:46:53-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We usually have a few loaner paddles and balls in a bin by the door, but they go quickly, so if you have your own, bring it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:47:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have one. I'll take the loaner then. [pause] And the roads, with the storm, from Friday. Is the gym open? It was Friday into Saturday, the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:47:16-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the nor'easter. The gym's open as normal this week. If anything changes we post it on the city page, but Tuesday should be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:47:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Good. [pause] Can I ask you something? How long have you worked there? At the, at the recreation."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:47:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sure. I've been here about eleven years now. Started part time and just stayed on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:47:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eleven years. That's a long time. So you know the programs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:47:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do, pretty well. If you have other questions when you come in, ask for me or anyone at the front desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:47:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So Tuesday, nine o'clock. [pause] Yes. That's what I have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:48:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, Tuesday at nine. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:48:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you very much. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:48:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a great day, and enjoy the game!"
    }
  ],
